; -- J.Gumban -- panel/label/button layout + Akeanon button labels ("Mag-adto" /
; "Balik") carried over unchanged. Dropped the two stray "pressed" -> CenterContainer
; connections from the original file: they pointed at _on_go_button_pressed /
; _on_back_button_pressed on CenterContainer, a node with no script — dead editor
; leftover, not used. region_popup.gd's _ready() already connects both buttons
; correctly (go_button.pressed.connect(_on_go_pressed), etc).

[node name="RegionPopup" type="CanvasLayer"]
script = ExtResource("1_7l8ch")

[node name="CenterContainer" type="CenterContainer" parent="."]
